1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,253
Your towel grows a film
of bacteria.

2
00:00:02,703 --> 00:00:04,409
The claim: use
disposable

3
00:00:04,409 --> 00:00:05,992
towels for ideal skin.

4
00:00:05,992 --> 00:00:07,297
Let's check the receipt.

5
00:00:07,747 --> 00:00:08,644
Line one.

6
00:00:08,644 --> 00:00:10,347
Does that film really
form?

7
00:00:10,347 --> 00:00:11,964
One study gave new
cotton

8
00:00:11,964 --> 00:00:13,954
towels to twenty-six
households.

9
00:00:14,404 --> 00:00:16,441
Six months of normal
home use.

10
00:00:16,441 --> 00:00:18,654
Every two months, they
tested the towels.

11
00:00:19,104 --> 00:00:21,685
By month two, the towels
smelled and looked dull.

12
00:00:21,685 --> 00:00:23,738
Under a microscope:
biofilm.

13
00:00:24,188 --> 00:00:25,740
Live bacteria counts
were

14
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,134
highest at month six.

15
00:00:27,134 --> 00:00:28,451
The film kept building.

16
00:00:28,901 --> 00:00:30,064
That line holds up.

17
00:00:30,514 --> 00:00:31,414
Line two.

18
00:00:31,414 --> 00:00:33,176
Is it your own skin's
bacteria?

19
00:00:33,176 --> 00:00:34,261
Mostly not.

20
00:00:34,261 --> 00:00:36,028
Staph was well under one
percent.

21
00:00:36,478 --> 00:00:38,664
The authors think
bacteria that suit

22
00:00:38,664 --> 00:00:40,555
towel fibres move in and
settle.

23
00:00:41,005 --> 00:00:41,956
Line three.

24
00:00:41,956 --> 00:00:43,659
Does the film hurt your
skin?

25
00:00:43,659 --> 00:00:45,066
The study never looked
at

26
00:00:45,066 --> 00:00:46,959
anyone's skin health or
infections.

27
00:00:47,409 --> 00:00:49,126
And disposable towels?

28
00:00:49,126 --> 00:00:50,915
This study didn't test
those either.

29
00:00:51,365 --> 00:00:54,537
What dermatologists do
say: never share towels.

30
00:00:54,537 --> 00:00:56,451
And pat your skin dry
with a clean one.

31
00:00:56,901 --> 00:00:58,524
Receipt total: unknown.

32
00:00:59,774 --> 00:01:01,005
The film is real.

33
00:01:01,005 --> 00:01:02,284
Harm to your skin?

34
00:01:02,284 --> 00:01:03,240
Unproven.

35
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:05,685
Dermatologists say
clean, and not shared.

36
00:01:06,135 --> 00:01:08,088
A dermatologist can
check your skin.

